<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection 5(4) of the principal Act as introduced by this Act, a member of the Commission who was appointed or reappointed before the coming into operation of this Act and who has not completed his term of office immediately before the coming into operation of this Act, may continue to hold office for the remainder of his term of office."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@> .
