<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "a member of the Commission who was appointed for the first time before the coming into operation of this Act and is holding office at the time of the coming into operation of this Act is eligible to be reappointed once for a period of three years under subsection 5(4) of the principal Act as introduced by this Act upon the expiry of his term of office;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/9/eng@> .
